title: Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BookStore
location: town
---

This stall has a rustic look, made of weathered wood and hung with old but well-cared-for tapestries, many of which are hidden by heaps of books. 
Most of the books look kind of boring for your purposes, but there are three that catch your eye.
-> A book about how to be a perfect officer.
    This book is a manual written by someone who served as an admiral about sixty years ago. She’s writing about how she rose through the ranks and what it means to be a leader.
    -> Ask the bookseller what it’s about.
        Bookseller: That one has some good information but is a bit dry. If you’re dead set on climbing the ranks, it’s a good pick, but beyond that…
        -> Buy the book. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift>>
        -> Look at something else. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_Bookstore>>
    -> Buy the book.  
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_Bookstore>>
-> A book about a boy who befriends a wolf.
    It looks like an adventure story about a man who gets shipwrecked and makes friends with a wolf. 
    -> Ask the bookseller what it’s about.
        Bookseller: It’s a really good adventure, but the main character has to kill the wolf with his own hands at the end. It’s pretty graphic.
        -> Buy the book. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BadGift>>
        -> Look at something else. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_Bookstore>>
    -> Buy the book. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BadGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_Bookstore>>
-> A book about history.
    It looks like a well researched tome on the history of the West Blue.
    -> Ask the bookseller what it’s about.
        Bookseller: That author gets a lot of detail into his books. It’s pretty interesting.
        -> Buy the book. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift>>
        -> Look at something else. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_Bookstore>>
    -> Buy the book. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_Bookstore>>
-> Check another stall. 
    <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SelectStall>>
