title: Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SoapShop
location: town
---

This shop smells good but also a bit overwhelming. It offers row upon row of creams and powders, but in the end, you narrow it down to three potential presents.
-> A bottle of lotion.
    The glass bottle is beautifully crafted, and the lotion within smells like a mix of vanilla and lilac, but a little spicier.
    -> Ask the proprietor about the lotion.
        Proprietor: This is one of our top sellers. The flowers only grow on a remote, frozen island in North Blue, and the scent is subtle but can even last through a day’s hard work.
        -> Buy the lotion. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift>>
        -> Look at something else. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SoapShop>>
    -> Buy the lotion. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SoapShop>>
-> A jar of wrinkle cream.
    It’s a small jar made of black glass with an unscented cream inside.
    -> Ask the proprietor about the wrinkle cream.
        Proprietor: That’s a great gift for anyone fighting the hands of time. It’s light, non-greasy and works almost like magic!
        -> Buy the wrinkle cream. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BadGift>>
        -> Look at something else. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SoapShop>>
    -> Buy the wrinkle cream. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BadGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SoapShop>>
-> A bar of handmade soap.
    It’s light green and has a citrus-like scent. Each bar comes wrapped in waxed paper with a pretty design on it.
    -> Ask the proprietor about the soap.
        Proprietor: The artisan lives further up the Grand Line. A shop here at headquarters carries some of their more common soaps, but we never have enough of this one. It’s made with a rare undersea fruit. 
        -> Buy the soap. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_PerfectGift>>
        -> Look at something else. 
            <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SoapShop>>
    -> Buy the soap. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_PerfectGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SoapShop>>
-> Check another stall. 
    <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SelectStall>>
