title: Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_WeaponShop
location: town
---

A woman nods to you as you walk up. There are a variety of weapon types hanging on racks or collected in boxes, along with shelves of weapon-care items. You find a few interesting items.
-> A hand axe.
    It’s a light weapon, well balanced for throwing or swinging. The edge is razor sharp.
    -> Buy the axe. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BadGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_WeaponShop>>
-> A cleaning kit for bladed weapons.
    This item contains all the items anyone could need for maintaining the edge on a bladed weapon and keeping the steel clean and polished.
    -> Buy the kit. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_WeaponShop>>
-> A gun.
    This gun is a step up from anything issued by the Marines as part of a typical loadout. It probably shoots straighter as well.
    -> Buy the gun. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BadGift>>
    -> Look at something else. 
        <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_WeaponShop>>
-> Check another stall. 
    <<jump Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_SelectStall>>
