title: Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_PerfectGift
location: town
---
As you head back, you find yourself excited to give him this gift. You feel sure he’s going to love it. 
==

title: Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_GoodGift
location: town
---

While you might have been able to find something better if you spent longer at the market, you feel confident in what you’ve chosen.
===

title: Helmeppo_Gift_Hunt_BadGift
location: town
---

As you leave the fair with your gift, you can’t help but feel uneasy. Will he really like this?
===
